  "question": {
    "text": "$X Y$ is the membrane / partition between two chambers 1 and 2 containing sugar solutions of concentration $c_1$ and $c_2\\left(c_1 \\gt c_2\\right) \\mathrm{mol} \\mathrm{L}^{-1}$. For the reverse osmosis to take place identify the correct condition<br />(Here $p_1$ and $p_2$ are pressures applied on chamber 1 and 2)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/-dNZdN-4rlHmVkUgxMoYKNgMBv45UbU5eMz2VyCl9Ks.original.fullsize.png\"/><br />(A) Membrane/Partition; Cellophane, $\\mathrm{p}_1 \\gt \\pi$<br />(B) Membrane/Partition ; Porous. $\\mathrm{p}_2 \\gt \\pi$<br />(C) Membrane/Partition ; Parchment paper, $\\mathrm{p}_1 \\gt \\pi$<br />(D) Membrane/Partition : Cellophane, $\\mathrm{p}_2 \\gt \\pi$<br />Choose the correct answer from the option given below :",
    "image": null
  },
